abstract: >
  An orientation-resolved Riemannian four-simplex vertex is analysed at
  leading large spin for coherent nondegenerate boundary data. The published
  result is a single-vertex statement and does not establish a continuum
  limit, control the bulk spin sum, derive Lorentzian or nonlinear dynamics,
  or derive four-dimensional general relativity.
